<%# locals: (title:, param:, options:, current:) %>
<%# A filter above a list, as plugins render it (the plugin contract, to 7.0): runeui's ui :filter,
    which the core's own pages call directly. A pill in a GET form of its own that swaps one query
    param of this page's address and keeps the others, so filters are bookmarkable and Back works.
    title names it ("Owner…"); a list past eight choices gets a box to search it. %>
<%= ui :filter, param: param, label: title.to_s.delete_suffix("…"), value: current.to_s, any: false, options: options.map { |text, value| [ text, value.to_s ] }, search: options.size > 8 %>
